<H1><EM>FOOTPRINTS Newsletter #10 - </EM><FONT color=#0000ff size=1>For earlier ones see the </FONT></A><FONT color=#0000ff size=1><A href="http://www.planetextinction.com/planet_extinction_archive.htm" target=_blank>archive</A>.</FONT></H1>
